usage: freeze-and-verify.py [-h] [--root ROOT] [--execute] [--run-id RUN_ID]
                            [--formal-manifest FORMAL_MANIFEST]
                            [--formal-hap FORMAL_HAP]
                            [--expected-hap-sha256 EXPECTED_HAP_SHA256]

Freeze this task's material scope and prove its binary patch reconstructs it.

No build/device/network commands. The real repository index/HEAD are read-only.
Run --help freely. --execute is intended only after the orchestrator's explicit GO.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT           This task root only (default: D:/HCUP/cml-spec28)
  --execute             Freeze and verify; use only after Root explicitly
                        sends GO. Without this flag no files are changed.
  --run-id RUN_ID       New safe validation run directory name; existing
                        directories are rejected
  --formal-manifest FORMAL_MANIFEST
  --formal-hap FORMAL_HAP
  --expected-hap-sha256 EXPECTED_HAP_SHA256
